,"audio":"610011231","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“亲爱的，纯粹的数学之所以美丽，就在于它一点用也没有。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"48":{"step":[[48,50,""]],"type":1,"name":["“她”","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011232","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“因此它才能在这个肮脏的世界上保持高洁，尽管你们人类还是会把它拿去计算弹道。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"99":{"step":[[99,100,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"50":{"step":[[50,51,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011348","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她拒绝了合作邀请，并对我们的“暴雨”观测计划大加贬低。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"51":{"step":[[51,52,""]],"type":1,"name":["“她”","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011233","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“你们的观测站必将迎来失败！因为它仰赖的是脆弱的物理世界。你们的努力就像是在沙滩上钉下钉子——它只会随着下一次海潮的冲刷毁灭。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"52":{"step":[[52,53,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011696","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["当时，我回答：“也许这是沙上砌塔的无用功。可是总需要有人去做。在每一个沙滩上的角落都被遍历前，谁也不能断言我们脚下的世界已经是无可救药的废墟。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"53":{"step":[[53,54,""]],"type":1,"name":["“她”","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011234","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“哈哈哈，多么严谨、务实、理性的发言！可是亲爱的，这个世界就是废墟呀！”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"54":{"step":[[54,55,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011349","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["谈话无果而终。我不知道神秘学家对世界的仇恨来自何处，也许因为他们从未被这个世界接纳。我仍记得她恶毒地断言：","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"55":{"step":[[55,99,""]],"type":1,"name":["“她”","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011235","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“你们人类赖以为生的经验世界已经终结了。用你们最爱讥讽我们的话来说——为什么不接受现实呢？”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"57":{"step":[[57,58,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011350","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["可是，对于她所深信的灵知，那些用数字发布的预言，她也从未给出过任何有严格逻辑的证明细节。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"58":{"step":[[58,59,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011351","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["理由，理由竟是因为她在某块石头前发了禁言的誓……！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"59":{"step":[[59,60,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011352","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["所以这里只是一堆神棍的疯言疯语。我本以为她会有别于那些将前额叶的错乱误认为神意的疯子，结果还是如此。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"60":{"step":[[60,61,""]],"type":1,"name":["记录者","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610011353","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我以人类的理智起誓，我坚信这一切纯属荒谬。直到……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"61":{"step":[[61,62,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"62":{"step":[[62,63,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.jpg","choice":[]},"63":{"step":[[63,64,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,